            "🏆 <b>VIP RESULT</b>\n\n"
            f"#{coin}USDT 🚀 <b>TP2 HIT</b> ✅\n\n"
            "<blockquote>VIP-exclusive signal closed successfully.\n\n"
            "✅ TP1 Achieved\n"
            "✅ TP2 Achieved\n\n"
